        <briefdescription>
<para>Return the current plan-selection miss rate in [0.0, 1.0]. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Miss rate = fraction of queries where the selected plan was later flagged as sub-optimal by the <ref refid="classthemis_1_1performance_1_1phase3_1_1_bao_optimizer_1a1419d1bcb7ac7704988984d4dddc01f9" kindref="member">update_model()</ref> feedback loop.</para>
<para>Used by Loop 1 (HNSW/Query) in ContinuousLearningOrchestrator to decide whether to trigger retraining (threshold: &gt; 0.15).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>Miss rate in [0.0, 1.0]. Returns 0.0 when no queries have been optimized yet. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
